  "body": "\nIf `intent=` isn't set:\n\n- `delta` starts with `+` → `success` + up arrow\n- `delta` starts with `-` (or Unicode minus) → `danger` + down arrow\n- `delta` is `0` / blank / zero-valued → `muted` + flat arrow\n- Otherwise — parse as number, fallback to muted\n\n---\n\n",
